      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUNGRY BRONNIE NZ (2) led as a hot favourite last time but couldn't see it out. Had shown promise when kicking off for Brad Hewitt with a Wagga win prior. Has the speed to take advantage of the low draw so is worth another chance. LEXUS LOU (8) scored back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance before leading from a wide barrier last time but fading to finish midfield. Draws a little lower so can bounce back. ACTION MAJOR NZ (11) may need luck from the extreme outside barrier but the confidence will be high after finding winning form at Newcastle last week. VINCENZO (10) also draws out but recorded back-to-back placings here last month, one from a similar barrier to this so he is a player if things go his way.",
